amix-benchmark -- the amix-bench benchmark suite

The suite (the driver, iobench, fpbench, membench, vmbench and their shared
header) is MIT; see LICENSE.amix beside this file.

dhry is Dhrystone 2.1 by Reinhold P. Weicker and Rick Richardson (1988),
public domain, compiled as published.

The binaries link the startup objects and the shared libc of the stock Amiga
UNIX (Amix) SVR4 system.  On 2026-09-23 Amiga Corporation approved the
distribution of the Commodore Amiga binaries that this project builds on.

